# Repository description (GitHub "About")

## Copy this line into the GitHub About description field

```
chat.deepseek.com inside DSH Desktop: three entry points (conversation-view tab, left rail, main panel) share one signed-in page that survives panel switches and restarts; deepseek.com-only navigation, external links to your browser; zero host-side code, no injected scripts, no replayed requests. Desktop only. 中文 README: README.md
```

## About the language link at the top

GitHub's About description field is **plain text — it does not render Markdown links**. A `[English](...)` written there shows up as literal characters and cannot be clicked.

The place that is actually clickable and appears at the very top of the repository home page is **the README body**. So the language switch lives on the first line of each README:

- `README.md` line 1: `**简体中文** · [English](README.md.en)`
- `README.md.en` line 1: `[简体中文](README.md) · **English**`

The About description keeps a plain-text pointer (`中文 README: README.md`) so both sides find each other.

## Alternative: shorter About description

English (~200 chars):

```
chat.deepseek.com inside DSH Desktop: three entry points share one signed-in page. No injected scripts, no replayed requests, no host-side code.
```

Chinese (~60 chars):

```
在 DSH 桌面端里直接打开 chat.deepseek.com，三处入口共享同一个已登录页面。零注入、零代发请求。
```

## Repository settings worth setting at the same time

| Setting | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Topics | `dsh-plugin` (required for market listing), `dsh`, `electron`, `deepseek`, `webview` |
| Description | the line from "Copy this line" above |
| Website | leave empty, or the DSH homepage |
